-RIRI: And no worries.

861
00:46:24,949 --> 00:46:26,951
I got a special delivery
for y'all in three,

862
00:46:27,118 --> 00:46:28,536
two, one...

863
00:46:30,079 --> 00:46:31,163
SHURI: Nice one, Riri!

864
00:46:31,247 --> 00:46:32,581
We got the glow
We got the soul

865
00:46:32,665 --> 00:46:33,874
We got the wave

866
00:46:33,958 --> 00:46:35,418
RIRI: Whoo!

867
00:46:36,627 --> 00:46:37,962
(GASPS, YELPS)

868
00:46:38,504 --> 00:46:39,505
(GROANS)

869
00:46:40,423 --> 00:46:41,465
-SHURI: Riri!
-(GASPS)

870
00:46:53,269 --> 00:46:54,854
(DEVICE WHIRS)

871
00:47:08,492 --> 00:47:11,579
(GASPING) What just happened?
Shuri!

872
00:47:12,121 --> 00:47:13,122
Shuri!

873
00:47:23,299 --> 00:47:25,301
(OKOYE BREATHING SHAKILY)

874
00:47:27,928 --> 00:47:29,138
(KIMOYO BEADS TRILL)

875
00:47:29,221 --> 00:47:31,474
GRIOT: The Princess's vitals
are stable, General.

876
00:47:31,640 --> 00:47:34,226
She should regain
consciousness momentarily.

877
00:47:34,310 --> 00:47:36,020
(SUIT SCRAPING)

878
00:47:39,815 --> 00:47:40,816
(GRUNTS)

879
00:47:40,900 --> 00:47:42,443
(ROPE RETRACTING)

880
00:47:43,069 --> 00:47:44,070
(METAL CLANKS)

881
00:47:48,532 --> 00:47:49,950
(WARRIORS GRUNT)

882
00:47:50,868 --> 00:47:52,119
(GASPS)

883
00:47:52,203 --> 00:47:54,205
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

884
00:47:55,956 --> 00:47:57,124
(GRUNTS)

885
00:48:08,677 --> 00:48:10,763
Take another step closer

886
00:48:11,555 --> 00:48:13,057
and I will kill you all.

887
00:48:13,766 --> 00:48:14,975
OFFICER: (ON SPEAKER)
Drop your weapons!

888
00:48:17,603 --> 00:48:18,771
(INOTHER LANGUAGE)

889
00:48:23,567 --> 00:48:24,693
(IN ENGLISH) Hey, is she blue?

890
00:48:25,069 --> 00:48:26,570
-(GRUNTS)
-(OFFICER GROANS)

891
00:48:26,654 --> 00:48:27,905
(INOTHER LANGUAGE)

892
00:48:29,573 --> 00:48:30,574
(IN ENGLISH) Drop your weapon!

893
00:48:31,492 --> 00:48:32,910
(GUNSHOTS)

894
00:48:33,244 --> 00:48:35,579
(ALL GRUNTING)

895
00:48:44,713 --> 00:48:46,715
(WARRIORS GROANING)

896
00:48:55,391 --> 00:48:56,934
(BOTH GRUNTING)

897
00:49:01,355 --> 00:49:02,690
(GROWLS)

898
00:49:04,650 --> 00:49:05,985
(INOTHER LANGUAGE)

899
00:49:09,238 --> 00:49:11,365
(UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING)

900
00:49:14,118 --> 00:49:15,327
(AX CLANGS)

901
00:49:19,039 --> 00:49:20,374
(BOTH GRUNTING)

902
00:49:31,177 --> 00:49:32,678
(PANTING)

903
00:49:54,492 --> 00:49:55,993
(MALE WARRIOR YELLS)

904
00:49:56,076 --> 00:49:58,078
-(OKOYE YELLS)
-(GROANING)

905
00:50:03,667 --> 00:50:05,794
(OKOYE GASPING AND GROANING)

906
00:50:19,141 --> 00:50:20,809
-(GRUNTS)
-(KIMOYO BEADS TRILL)

907
00:50:20,893 --> 00:50:22,561
-(CRACKLES)
-(GRUNTS)

908
00:50:22,645 --> 00:50:24,438
(GROANS LOUDLY)

909
00:50:25,523 --> 00:50:27,608
(BOTH YELLING)

910
00:50:27,691 --> 00:50:29,318
-(SPEAR VIBRATING)
-(GRUNTS)

911
00:50:30,945 --> 00:50:32,154
(NAMORA SPEAKING)

912
00:50:36,325 --> 00:50:37,326
(GRUNTS)

913
00:50:44,667 --> 00:50:45,751
SHURI: (MUFFLED) Okoye!

914
00:50:47,253 --> 00:50:48,254
(IN ENGLISH) Wait!

915
00:50:48,337 --> 00:50:49,713
GRIOT: Activating
interpretation.

916
00:50:49,797 --> 00:50:50,965
-I'm Shuri.
-(GRIOT TRANSLATING)

917
00:50:51,048 --> 00:50:52,341
Princess of Wakanda.

918
00:50:52,800 --> 00:50:54,593
I demand that you take me
to Namor.

919
00:50:54,760 --> 00:50:56,845
Do not bring harm
to this girl.

920
00:50:57,846 --> 00:50:59,473
(SPEAKING OTHER LANGUAGE)

921
00:50:59,557 --> 00:51:01,642
GRIOT: (TRANSLATING)
Do we take them both alive?

922
00:51:01,934 --> 00:51:04,228
-(SPEAKING OTHER LANGUAGE)
-GRIOT: Yes, Attuma.

923
00:51:04,562 --> 00:51:05,854
(AX CLANGS)

924
00:51:06,313 --> 00:51:08,315
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

925
00:51:09,817 --> 00:51:11,151
(MASK HISSES)

926
00:51:16,323 --> 00:51:17,449
(MASK HISSES)

927
00:51:19,326 --> 00:51:20,452
(SPEAKING OTHER LANGUAGE)

928
00:51:20,536 --> 00:51:21,662
GRIOT: Breathe.

929
00:51:21,745 --> 00:51:23,289
(INHALES DEEPLY)

930
00:51:24,915 --> 00:51:26,959
(COUGHING AND GASPING)

931
00:51:30,588 --> 00:51:31,589
Shuri!

932
00:51:36,969 --> 00:51:38,637
(SCREAMING)

933
00:51:42,808 --> 00:51:44,893
-(INDISTINCT RADIO CHATTER)
-(EXHALES)

934
00:51:50,024 --> 00:51:52,693
Ross, from the Agency.
You got any witnesses?

935
00:51:52,860 --> 00:51:55,070
None. But we think
it was the Wakandans.

936
00:51:55,446 --> 00:51:56,447
Excuse me?

937
00:51:56,530 --> 00:51:57,656
Our field office
got a tip from Langley

938
00:51:57,740 --> 00:51:58,741
that they were coming.

939
00:51:58,907 --> 00:52:00,701
Right. Who made that call?

940
00:52:01,744 --> 00:52:03,120
-She did.
-AGENT: Director de Fontaine.

941
00:52:05,539 --> 00:52:06,915
Director de Fontaine.

942
00:52:06,999 --> 00:52:08,000
Really?

943
00:52:08,083 --> 00:52:09,084
Well...

944
00:52:10,085 --> 00:52:11,962
Uh, Agent thinks
it was the Wakandans.

945
00:52:12,504 --> 00:52:14,006
Yeah, we've been
on every one of them

946
00:52:14,089 --> 00:52:15,090
since they took out our ship.

947
00:52:15,174 --> 00:52:16,592
That's why I wanted you here.

948
00:52:17,676 --> 00:52:18,761
You're lookin' good.

949
00:52:18,844 --> 00:52:20,429
Oh. Well, I try.

950
00:52:20,596 --> 00:52:22,097
DE FONTAINE: You put
that home gym in?

951
00:52:22,181 --> 00:52:23,182
ROSS: Yeah. Last year.

952
00:52:23,349 --> 00:52:26,060
Maybe I'll drop by sometime
and jump on your Peloton.

953
00:52:26,810 --> 00:52:27,811
Howdy.

954
00:52:27,895 --> 00:52:29,647
-I'm special agent in charge.
-Oh, good for you.

955
00:52:29,730 --> 00:52:31,899
You wanna walk me through
the evidence here, or what?

956
00:52:32,066 --> 00:52:34,234
-Yeah. Okay. After you.
-Yeah. Okay.

957
00:52:34,318 --> 00:52:35,527
-All right.
-So, what happened here?

958
00:52:36,153 --> 00:52:37,738
Um, we think
it was a car crash,

959
00:52:37,905 --> 00:52:39,657
but we're having trouble
finding the cars.

960
00:52:39,740 --> 00:52:40,783
DE FONTAINE: What do you mean?

961
00:52:40,866 --> 00:52:42,159
It was just like this
when you found it?

962
00:52:42,242 --> 00:52:43,869
SPECIAL AGENT: Yes.
We think someone involved

963
00:52:43,952 --> 00:52:44,953
got rid of the vehicles.

964
00:52:45,037 --> 00:52:46,205
DE FONTAINE:
Got rid of them how?

965
00:52:46,288 --> 00:52:47,748
SPECIAL AGENT: They dumped
them into the river.

966
00:52:47,915 --> 00:52:49,124
DE FONTAINE:
You're kidding me.

967
00:52:50,167 --> 00:52:51,752
It's got an MIT sticker on it.

968
00:52:51,919 --> 00:52:54,296
I want that transferred
to the NSA immediately.

969
00:52:54,463 --> 00:52:56,548
Hey, Ross?
You got a full tank of gas?

970
00:52:56,715 --> 00:52:58,384
Can you give me a ride
back to Langley?

971
00:52:58,467 --> 00:53:00,678
ROSS: (HESITATES)
It's an eight-hour drive.

972
00:53:00,761 --> 00:53:02,137
DE FONTAINE: Yeah.
We can talk about the case.

973
00:53:02,304 --> 00:53:04,682
Actually, wouldn't mind...
(CLEARS THROAT)

974
00:53:04,765 --> 00:53:06,934
apologizing to you
for a couple of things I said

975
00:53:07,017 --> 00:53:08,060
during our marriage.

976
00:53:11,438 --> 00:53:12,690
OKOYE: They were blue.

977
00:53:13,732 --> 00:53:15,567
And they had
superhuman strength.

978
00:53:16,485 --> 00:53:19,321
And they came from the water
on the backs of whales.

979
00:53:20,197 --> 00:53:21,865
I struck down three of them

980
00:53:21,949 --> 00:53:23,409
with blows
that should've killed them,

981
00:53:23,492 --> 00:53:25,202
but they rose again.

982
00:53:25,369 --> 00:53:28,622
I wish to leave immediately
to retrieve our princess.

983
00:53:40,426 --> 00:53:41,635
RAMONDA: Okoye,

984
00:53:42,010 --> 00:53:44,430
you will be
stripped of your rank

985
00:53:44,513 --> 00:53:46,515
as General of Wakanda's armies

986
00:53:46,598 --> 00:53:49,560
and your status
as Dora Milaje.

987
00:53:54,356 --> 00:53:55,524
(IN XHOSA)

988
00:53:57,860 --> 00:53:58,902
(IN ENGLISH) You may.

989
00:53:59,403 --> 00:54:00,863
(IN XHOSA)

990
00:54:02,865 --> 00:54:04,324
(IN ENGLISH)
I have given everything.

991
00:54:05,284 --> 00:54:09,079
Let me die saving my country
and that throne.

992
00:54:09,246 --> 00:54:10,622
(IN XHOSA)

993
00:54:11,415 --> 00:54:13,208
(IN ENGLISH) Allow me
to make this right.

994
00:54:13,292 --> 00:54:14,585
"Make it right"?

995
00:54:15,127 --> 00:54:16,128
(CRIES)

996
00:54:16,211 --> 00:54:19,339
I do not know if my daughter
is alive or dead.

997
00:54:19,506 --> 00:54:22,760
Perhaps we are being
too hasty.

998
00:54:22,843 --> 00:54:24,178
M'BAKU: Mmm.

999
00:54:24,845 --> 00:54:29,224
She raised a spear against
her own husband for Wakanda.

1000
00:54:29,391 --> 00:54:31,935
Where is her
treacherous husband now

1001
00:54:32,102 --> 00:54:36,398
but in a place where she can
visit if she wished? Mine...

1002
00:54:37,691 --> 00:54:39,568
is with the ancestors.

1003
00:54:39,651 --> 00:54:44,448
lam Queen of the most
powerful nation in the world,

1004
00:54:44,615 --> 00:54:47,826
and my entire family is gone!

1005
00:54:48,660 --> 00:54:51,455
Have I not given everything?

1006
00:55:00,631 --> 00:55:02,549
On your feet, General.

1007
00:55:08,722 --> 00:55:10,933
I stood by you

1008
00:55:11,099 --> 00:55:14,728
after Killmonger
took the throne,

1009
00:55:14,895 --> 00:55:18,482
and you and the elders
in this room stood by him

1010
00:55:18,649 --> 00:55:22,277
while I ran begging
to the Jabari for protection.

1011
00:55:23,654 --> 00:55:25,072
And I warned you

1012
00:55:25,155 --> 00:55:28,033
about taking my daughter
on this mission,

1013
00:55:28,200 --> 00:55:30,118
and you lost her.

1014
00:55:30,869 --> 00:55:32,371
So, today,

1015
00:55:33,288 --> 00:55:35,457
lam done. (BREATH SHUDDERS)

1016
00:55:36,291 --> 00:55:38,293
(GRAVE MUSIC PLAYING)

1017
00:55:45,008 --> 00:55:47,386
(SIGHS DEEPLY)

1018
00:56:02,943 --> 00:56:04,778
(DOOR WHIRS)

1019
00:56:21,545 --> 00:56:24,089
Are you here, GRIOT?

1020
00:56:25,424 --> 00:56:26,675
GRIOT: Yes, my Queen.

1021
00:56:27,718 --> 00:56:31,096
Were you with Shuri
when she was abducted?

1022
00:56:31,263 --> 00:56:32,556
GRIOT: / was.

1023
00:56:32,723 --> 00:56:35,475
Are you able to track
her Kimoyo Beads?

1024
00:56:35,642 --> 00:56:38,061
DE FONTAINE: Ballistics found
slugs all over Cambridge.

1025
00:56:38,145 --> 00:56:40,230
Those Wakandans really
took a tour of the city.

1026
00:56:40,314 --> 00:56:41,315
ROSS: Hmm.

1027
00:56:41,398 --> 00:56:43,150
I can't see how
they figured out who built it.

1028
00:56:43,233 --> 00:56:45,652
That information
is highly classified.

1029
00:56:46,445 --> 00:56:48,030
(DEVICE CHIMES SOFTLY)

1030
00:56:48,906 --> 00:56:49,907
What is that?

1031
00:56:49,990 --> 00:56:51,408
-That's a new ringtone?
-Oh, shit.

1032
00:56:52,743 --> 00:56:54,828
Uh, Director, I'm sorry.
I'm gonna have to take this.

1033
00:56:54,912 --> 00:56:56,121
It's enough
with the titles.

1034
00:56:56,204 --> 00:56:57,372
Just take it. I don't care.

1035
00:56:57,456 --> 00:56:58,665
Hey, honey sweetheart.

1036
00:56:58,749 --> 00:57:00,375
Ooh. (CHUCKLES)

1037
00:57:00,459 --> 00:57:03,003
Uh, no, I'm...
I'm with my boss. Now.

1038
00:57:03,712 --> 00:57:05,088
Actually, she's leaving.

1039
00:57:05,255 --> 00:57:06,256
All right.

1040
00:57:06,423 --> 00:57:08,884
I'm gonna work from home,
and then have a shower.

1041
00:57:11,094 --> 00:57:12,095
(CAR STARTS)

1042
00:57:14,598 --> 00:57:16,183
(KIMOYO BEADS CHIRP)

1043
00:57:16,266 --> 00:57:17,768
Everett Ross.

1044
00:57:17,935 --> 00:57:19,061
Queen Ramonda?

1045
00:57:19,227 --> 00:57:21,188
What are you doing
with Shuri's Kimoyo Beads?

1046
00:57:21,271 --> 00:57:23,231
I didn't know they were hers.
All right?

1047
00:57:23,315 --> 00:57:25,567
I just found them
at a pretty ugly crime scene.

1048
00:57:26,610 --> 00:57:27,736
Do you have the student?

1049
00:57:28,612 --> 00:57:31,573
Shuri was trying to save her
when they were both taken.

1050
00:57:32,491 --> 00:57:33,951
What? Taken by who?

1051
00:57:35,535 --> 00:57:37,579
My agency assumes it was you.

1052
00:57:37,663 --> 00:57:39,706
And I'm worried
they might be onto the fact

1053
00:57:39,790 --> 00:57:42,042
that I pointed Shuri and Okoye
in the right direction.

1054
00:57:42,209 --> 00:57:43,919
Look, if they're in danger,
I wanna help.

1055
00:57:44,002 --> 00:57:45,921
But I can't if I don't know
what's going on.

1056
00:57:46,088 --> 00:57:48,799
I am afraid there is
a new world power at play.

1057
00:57:49,216 --> 00:57:51,176
A country
that's already on our radar?

1058
00:57:51,259 --> 00:57:52,260
Or you mean someone else?

1059
00:57:52,344 --> 00:57:54,346
RAMONDA: That is all I can say for now.

1060
00:57:54,513 --> 00:57:55,514
Please,

1061
00:57:55,931 --> 00:57:58,600
alert me if your government
decides to act

1062
00:57:58,684 --> 00:58:00,268
on their suspicions.

1063
00:58:00,352 --> 00:58:01,520
Yeah. Sure.

1064
00:58:02,104 --> 00:58:06,108
Uh, look, if there's anything
I can do to help, let me know.

1065
00:58:06,274 --> 00:58:08,068
I owe Shuri my life.

1066
00:58:08,819 --> 00:58:12,739
GRIOT, did Shuri have
her earrings with her?

1067
00:58:12,906 --> 00:58:15,450
GRIOT: / lost track of them
in the North Atlantic,

1068
00:58:15,617 --> 00:58:18,787
but the people who took her
spoke Yucatec Mayan.

1069
00:58:28,922 --> 00:58:29,923
(RAMONDA SPEAKING
HAITIAN CREOLE)

1070
00:59:07,044 --> 00:59:08,920
-Hmm?
-GIRL 1: Oui, Miss Nakia.

1071
00:59:11,506 --> 00:59:12,507
(GIRL 1 SPEAKING)

1072
00:59:12,591 --> 00:59:13,592
(GIRL 2 SPEAKING)

1073
00:59:19,389 --> 00:59:20,640
(IN ENGLISH) Queen Mother.

1074
00:59:22,476 --> 00:59:24,770
Everything is a lesson here
for the children.

1075
00:59:24,936 --> 00:59:27,939
They painted the walls,
they feed the fish,

1076
00:59:28,106 --> 00:59:30,400
and they grow
everything we eat here.

1077
00:59:30,567 --> 00:59:33,195
I recognize
some of the concepts here.

1078
00:59:33,361 --> 00:59:35,322
But you are using
different material.

1079
00:59:35,489 --> 00:59:38,825
Yes, we use strictly what
we can find here in Haiti.

1080
00:59:40,827 --> 00:59:44,164
You were missed
at T'Challa's funeral.

1081
00:59:47,292 --> 00:59:48,293
Oh...

1082
00:59:55,926 --> 00:59:57,135
(QUIETLY) Queen Mother.

1083
00:59:57,302 --> 01:00:00,263
RAMONDA.: It's been six years
since you left us.

1084
01:00:00,430 --> 01:00:03,600
I thought you would at least
come back for the ceremony.

1085
01:00:06,353 --> 01:00:07,854
I was afraid

1086
01:00:08,730 --> 01:00:12,526
of how final
the funeral would be.

1087
01:00:12,609 --> 01:00:15,654
Nakia, daughter of Yaa,

1088
01:00:16,947 --> 01:00:20,826
wherever you go,
you are still Wakandan,

1089
01:00:20,992 --> 01:00:24,621
and you know
death is not the end.

1090
01:00:29,709 --> 01:00:31,002
(IN XHOSA)

1091
01:00:35,757 --> 01:00:37,509
(IN ENGLISH)
How is everyone at home?

1092
01:00:37,676 --> 01:00:40,011
Shuri has been taken.

1093
01:00:40,720 --> 01:00:41,721
What?

1094
01:00:42,139 --> 01:00:45,142
You have infiltrated
many nations before.

1095
01:00:45,559 --> 01:00:46,852
(IN XHOSA)

1096
01:00:47,561 --> 01:00:48,895
(IN ENGLISH)
I was a different person then.

1097
01:00:48,979 --> 01:00:52,023
I need someone who can find
where she is being held,

1098
01:00:52,190 --> 01:00:55,235
and rescue her,
without being seen.

1099
01:00:55,610 --> 01:00:58,446
Who on earth would risk war
with Wakanda?

1100
01:01:00,824 --> 01:01:01,908
RIRI: Oh, my God. (GASPING)

1101
01:01:01,992 --> 01:01:03,285
SHURI: Okay, breathe. Breathe.

1102
01:01:03,368 --> 01:01:04,828
Oh, don't tell me to breathe.

1103
01:01:04,995 --> 01:01:05,996
Where the hell are we?

1104
01:01:06,163 --> 01:01:08,290
We're in a cave.
I'm not sure where.

1105
01:01:08,373 --> 01:01:09,374
Oh, my God!

1106
01:01:09,916 --> 01:01:11,501
(GASPS) What is that?

1107
01:01:11,668 --> 01:01:14,421
SHURI: Glow worms.
Their larva gives off light.

1108
01:01:14,504 --> 01:01:16,423
-(RIRI GASPS HEAVILY)
-SHURI: Just calm down.

1109
01:01:16,840 --> 01:01:18,717
Okay, is there, like,
a new Black Panther

1110
01:01:18,800 --> 01:01:20,051
that you can call
to come and get us?

1111
01:01:20,135 --> 01:01:21,136
No.

1112
01:01:21,219 --> 01:01:22,220
Why not?

1113
01:01:22,304 --> 01:01:24,097
Because it doesn't
work like that anymore.

1114
01:01:24,848 --> 01:01:26,433
The Black Panther is gone.

1115
01:01:27,100 --> 01:01:28,185
So y'all stopped
having Black Panthers

1116
01:01:28,268 --> 01:01:29,269
when I get kidnapped?

1117
01:01:29,769 --> 01:01:31,771
(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC PLAYS)

1118
01:01:34,774 --> 01:01:35,775
(IN MAYAN)

1119
01:01:42,365 --> 01:01:44,534
(IN ENGLISH)
Do you understand her?

1120
01:01:44,701 --> 01:01:46,203
Not completely.

1121
01:01:48,288 --> 01:01:49,497
Nuh-uh.

1122
01:01:49,664 --> 01:01:52,000
That is some supervillain shit
right there.

1123
01:01:52,167 --> 01:01:53,501
That's in every movie.

1124
01:01:53,668 --> 01:01:54,920
Princess Leia.

1125
01:01:55,086 --> 01:01:56,338
Belle from
Beauty and the Beast.

1126
01:01:56,421 --> 01:01:59,049
That white chick
from Indiana Jones.

1127
01:01:59,132 --> 01:02:00,258
It's fine.

1128
01:02:00,342 --> 01:02:02,886
You should see what I have
to wear at Warrior Falls.

1129
01:02:03,803 --> 01:02:05,972
(MYSTERIOUS MUSIC CONTINUES)

1130
01:02:09,309 --> 01:02:10,310
(IN MAYAN)

1131
01:02:11,311 --> 01:02:12,729
(IN ENGLISH, HESITATES) Wait.

1132
01:02:12,812 --> 01:02:15,273
You're not leaving me in here,
are you?

1133
01:02:15,357 --> 01:02:16,816
I'm coming back.

1134
01:02:17,484 --> 01:02:18,693
I'm coming back.

1135
01:02:18,860 --> 01:02:20,779
Stay calm.

1136
01:02:28,161 --> 01:02:29,162
(IN MAYAN)

1137
01:02:30,914 --> 01:02:31,998
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

1138
01:02:33,416 --> 01:02:35,168
(CRYPTIC MUSIC PLAYING)

1139
01:02:38,171 --> 01:02:39,965
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

1140
01:02:40,757 --> 01:02:42,175
(GOATS BLEATING)

1141
01:02:43,343 --> 01:02:45,053
(IN SPANISH)

1142
01:03:14,833 --> 01:03:15,875
(IN MAYAN)

1143
01:03:17,585 --> 01:03:19,838
(CRYPTIC MUSIC CONTINUES)

1144
01:03:28,513 --> 01:03:30,015
(IN SPANISH)

1145
01:04:10,847 --> 01:04:12,807
(EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)

1146
01:04:29,824 --> 01:04:31,451
(IN ENGLISH) Princess.

1147
01:04:31,618 --> 01:04:32,619
Welcome.

1148
01:04:34,579 --> 01:04:37,040
Please, feel free.

1149
01:04:44,297 --> 01:04:45,590
This is beautiful.

1150
01:04:46,424 --> 01:04:48,176
That was my mother's.

1151
01:04:58,228 --> 01:05:00,772
These are all
Mesoamerican artifacts.

1152
01:05:02,232 --> 01:05:04,109
Most likely 16th century.

1153
01:05:05,318 --> 01:05:07,529
Have you been alive
since then?

1154
01:05:09,489 --> 01:05:11,032
Your mother was human.

1155
01:05:12,492 --> 01:05:13,493
She was.

1156
01:05:13,660 --> 01:05:15,870
Then she became
something else.

1157
01:05:16,037 --> 01:05:18,081
-How?
-"How?"

1158
01:05:18,665 --> 01:05:21,126
"How" is never
as important as "why."

1159
01:05:30,301 --> 01:05:32,303
(EERIE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1160
01:05:32,387 --> 01:05:33,847
NAMOR: My mother
and her village

1161
01:05:33,930 --> 01:05:35,515
were driven from their farms

1162
01:05:35,682 --> 01:05:39,436
by Spanish conquistadors
who brought the smallpox,

1163
01:05:39,602 --> 01:05:42,480
a hateful language,
and dogma from another world.

1164
01:05:44,274 --> 01:05:45,984
Facing starvation,

1165
01:05:46,151 --> 01:05:47,986
war, and disease,

1166
01:05:48,445 --> 01:05:50,238
my people turned to Chaac...

1167
01:05:51,906 --> 01:05:53,783
our god of rain and abundance.

1168
01:05:55,994 --> 01:05:58,830
Chaac gave our shaman
a vision...

1169
01:05:58,913 --> 01:06:01,583
-(GASPS)
-...a way to save his people.

1170
01:06:01,666 --> 01:06:03,918
(ARBOLES BAJO EL MAR PLAYING)

1171
01:06:05,587 --> 01:06:09,966
NAMOR: Chaac led him to a plant
sprouting from a blue rock.

1172
01:06:23,438 --> 01:06:25,648
My mother was pregnant with me
at the time,

1173
01:06:25,815 --> 01:06:28,067
and she did not want to
ingest the plant

1174
01:06:28,234 --> 01:06:30,445
for fear
of what it may do to me.

1175
01:06:30,945 --> 01:06:32,113
(IN MAYAN)

1176
01:06:32,614 --> 01:06:34,491
(IN ENGLISH)
But the Shaman was convincing.

1177
01:06:43,082 --> 01:06:45,001
(SHAMAN SPEAKING MAYAN)

1178
01:07:00,183 --> 01:07:02,727
(ARBOLES BAJO EL MAR
CONTINUES)

1179
01:07:06,356 --> 01:07:08,191
NAMOR: (IN ENGLISH)
They all fell sick.

1180
01:07:08,274 --> 01:07:09,275
(BODY THUDS)

1181
01:07:09,359 --> 01:07:11,194
And their lives,

1182
01:07:11,361 --> 01:07:13,488
their existence there,

1183
01:07:13,655 --> 01:07:14,948
ended.

1184
01:07:18,117 --> 01:07:20,495
(ALL GASPING FOR BREATH)

1185
01:07:26,834 --> 01:07:29,087
The plant took away
their ability to breathe air

1186
01:07:29,254 --> 01:07:33,049
but enabled them
to draw oxygen from the sea.

1187
01:07:36,386 --> 01:07:38,137
They settled in the ocean,

1188
01:07:38,805 --> 01:07:41,933
away from war and diseases.

1189
01:07:44,519 --> 01:07:45,603
(SHAMAN SPEAKING MAYAN)

1190
01:07:45,687 --> 01:07:46,729
(SHAMAN GRUNTS)

1191
01:07:50,024 --> 01:07:52,068
(EERIE MUSIC CONTINUES)

1192
01:07:58,366 --> 01:08:00,785
(WOMAN WHISPERING BLESSING
IN SPANISH)

1193
01:08:01,703 --> 01:08:03,121
(RITUALISTIC RHYTHMIC BLOWING)

1194
01:08:11,087 --> 01:08:13,256
(IN ENGLISH) My mother
gave birth to me there

1195
01:08:13,548 --> 01:08:16,801
and I became
the firstborn son of Talokan.

1196
01:08:17,260 --> 01:08:19,345
The plant gave me wings
on my ankles

1197
01:08:19,512 --> 01:08:21,931
and ears
that pointed to the clouds.

1198
01:08:22,390 --> 01:08:23,641
I was a mutant.

1199
01:08:24,559 --> 01:08:27,812
I could swim in the sky
and age slower.

1200
01:08:27,979 --> 01:08:30,481
Breathe the air
our ancestors breathed.

1201
01:08:31,733 --> 01:08:33,318
As she grew older,

1202
01:08:34,652 --> 01:08:38,239
my mother mourned the life
on land that she once knew...

1203
01:08:40,158 --> 01:08:41,909
and died with a broken heart.

1204
01:08:44,662 --> 01:08:46,289
She made me promise

1205
01:08:46,372 --> 01:08:48,625
to bury her
in the soil of her homeland.

1206
01:08:53,755 --> 01:08:56,674
Nothing could prepare me
for what I found there.

1207
01:08:56,758 --> 01:08:58,551
-(MEN SHOUTING)
-(WHIPS LASHING)

1208
01:08:58,635 --> 01:09:00,345
(SLAVES GROANING)

1209
01:09:00,428 --> 01:09:02,055
-(MAN SHOUTS IN SPANISH)
-(WOMAN GROANS)

1210
01:09:04,057 --> 01:09:05,141
(IN SPANISH)

1211
01:09:06,309 --> 01:09:07,310
Huh?

1212
01:09:07,935 --> 01:09:10,104
(EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)

1213
01:09:18,446 --> 01:09:20,281
(MUSIC SOURS)

1214
01:09:24,619 --> 01:09:25,787
(MEN SHOUTING)
